	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Tabs]]></title>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Click a tab to switch panels. You can also focus a tab and use the Left and Right arrow keys, Home and End. Each panel holds ordinary blocks, so a tab can contain text, lists, images or buttons.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:wpcomsp/tabs {"tabs":[{"title":"Overview","tabNumber":1,"isActive":true},{"title":"What grows","tabNumber":2,"isActive":false},{"title":"A typical plot","tabNumber":3,"isActive":false},{"title":"\u003cem\u003eQuestions\u003c/em\u003e","tabNumber":4,"isActive":false},{"title":"Join","tabNumber":5,"isActive":false}],"align":"wide"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wpcomsp-tabs alignwide"><div class="tabs-container"><div class="scroll-arrow scroll-arrow-left" role="button" aria-label="Scroll tabs left"></div><div role="tablist" class="tablist-wrapper"><div id="tab-1" role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tabpanel-1" tabindex="0"><span class="tab-button-text">Overview</span></div><div id="tab-2" role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabpanel-2" tabindex="-1"><span class="tab-button-text">What grows</span></div><div id="tab-3" role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabpanel-3" tabindex="-1"><span class="tab-button-text">A typical plot</span></div><div id="tab-4" role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabpanel-4" tabindex="-1"><span class="tab-button-text"><em>Questions</em></span></div><div id="tab-5" role="tab" class="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabpanel-5" tabindex="-1"><span class="tab-button-text">Join</span></div></div><div class="scroll-arrow scroll-arrow-right" role="button" aria-label="Scroll tabs right"></div></div><!-- wp:wpcomsp/tab {"title":"Overview"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wpcomsp-tab" id="tabpanel-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-1"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">A community garden</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The garden is open to everyone in the neighbourhood. Members share the tools, the compost and the harvest, and new growers are paired with someone who has been through a full season.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Use the other tabs to see what grows here, what a plot looks like, and how to join.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wpcomsp/tab -->

<!-- wp:wpcomsp/tab {"title":"What grows","tabNumber":2,"isActive":false} -->
<div class="wp-block-wpcomsp-tab" id="tabpanel-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-2" hidden><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">This season</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Tomatoes, peppers and squash in the raised beds</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Herbs along the south fence</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Sunflowers and beans on the climbing frames</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Wildflowers in the pollinator strip</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list --></div>
<!-- /wp:wpcomsp/tab -->

<!-- wp:wpcomsp/tab {"title":"A typical plot","tabNumber":3,"isActive":false} -->
<div class="wp-block-wpcomsp-tab" id="tabpanel-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-3" hidden><!-- wp:media-text {"mediaType":"image","mediaWidth":40} -->
<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile" style="grid-template-columns:40% auto"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://example.com/wp-content/themes/twentytwentyfive/assets/images/botany-flowers.webp" alt="Flowers in bloom"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Four by eight feet</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each plot is a raised bed with its own water point. Most growers fit two or three crops in a plot and rotate them every year.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>
<!-- /wp:media-text --></div>
<!-- /wp:wpcomsp/tab -->

<!-- wp:wpcomsp/tab {"title":"\u003cem\u003eQuestions\u003c/em\u003e","tabNumber":4,"isActive":false} -->
<div class="wp-block-wpcomsp-tab" id="tabpanel-4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-4" hidden><!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Do I need any experience?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>No. New members are paired with an experienced grower for their first season.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Are tools provided?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes. Hand tools, hoses and wheelbarrows are kept in the shed by the gate.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details -->

<!-- wp:details -->
<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>Is there a fee?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>There is a small yearly fee that pays for water and seed.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>
<!-- /wp:details --></div>
<!-- /wp:wpcomsp/tab -->

<!-- wp:wpcomsp/tab {"title":"Join","tabNumber":5,"isActive":false} -->
<div class="wp-block-wpcomsp-tab" id="tabpanel-5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-5" hidden><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Plots are offered in the order people sign up. Leave your name at the gate on any Saturday morning.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button">Visit on Saturday</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:wpcomsp/tab --></div>
<!-- /wp:wpcomsp/tabs -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"fontSize":"small"} -->
<p class="has-small-font-size">The fourth tab title is in italics: tab titles accept inline formatting such as italic, bold and links.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
